# What the server image's build (apps/server/Dockerfile, context: the repo root) may read. Everything
# is left out except what the Dockerfile copies, so no .env file, git history, local data or other
# app can reach the image.
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/server/
!packages/

# Never, even inside those folders.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/.env*
**/local-data
**/*.pem
**/*.log
